# Commits that only reformat the code, skipped by `git blame` so that each line keeps the commit that last changed
# what it does. Use it with `git blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs`, or once per clone with
# `git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs`; GitHub's blame view reads this file by itself.
# One full commit SHA per line. The black format commit (line length 100) is added here once its SHA is final.
